# Security Term Explainer 🛡️

A lightweight Generative AI application built with **LangChain**, **OpenAI (`gpt-4o-mini`)**, and **Gradio**. It provides clear, concise, and professional plain-language explanations of cybersecurity and IT concepts tailored specifically for security and IT professionals.

---

